{"html":["<div id=\"app\" style=\"height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\"><div data-testid=\"transcript\" class=\"scroller transcript s-FyadV6CSt3qI\" data-rows=\"1\" style=\"--rail-pad: 344px;\"><!----> <div class=\"column s-FyadV6CSt3qI\"><!----> <div class=\"row vrow s-FyadV6CSt3qI\" data-cursor=\"\" style=\"contain-intrinsic-size: auto 111px;\"><!----><!----><div data-role=\"assistant\" class=\"row assistant s-WovOnquG99wn\" data-item=\"a1\" data-streaming=\"false\"><div class=\"prose s-scqtGpnZLF0u\" role=\"presentation\"><!----><!----><div class=\"block s-scqtGpnZLF0u\"><p><strong>How a note reaches someone.</strong> You write the note into a scope. The note is sealed with a fresh key. Your next sync pushes the ciphertext to the hub. The other person's replica syncs, receives the scope's key for its device and sees the note.</p></div><!----></div><!----> <span class=\"stamp float s-WovOnquG99wn\" data-testid=\"stamp\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div><!----></div><!----> <!----> <div class=\"working s-FyadV6CSt3qI\" data-testid=\"working\"><!----></div></div> <div class=\"sentinel s-FyadV6CSt3qI\"></div> <div class=\"slack s-FyadV6CSt3qI\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height: 0px;\"></div></div> <!----> <!----></div>"],"css":["@keyframes rise{\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(6px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: none;\n  }\n}","@keyframes pulse-live{\n  0%, 100% {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n  50% {\n    opacity: 0.35;\n  }\n}","@keyframes s-HDoNyVVTt7GV-caret{ 0%, 45% { opacity: 1; } 46%, 100% { opacity: 0.15; } }","@keyframes s-HDoNyVVTt7GV-activity-spin{ to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }",".block.s-scqtGpnZLF0u{ display: contents; }",".s-scqtGpnZLF0u{}","@keyframes s-eg9sGMXSyR2H-pulse{ 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.35; } 50% { opacity: 1; } }",".row.s-WovOnquG99wn{ padding: 2px 0; position: relative; }",".assistant.s-WovOnquG99wn{ margin: 8px 0 14px; }",".stamp.s-WovOnquG99wn{\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    color: va